{"id":"7a118aa517b30e4d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-transfinite-induction.md","title":"Transfinite Induction","display":"df-transfinite-induction — Transfinite Induction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-transfinite-induction","aliases":["72-df-transfinite-induction"],"display":"df-transfinite-induction — Transfinite Induction","depends_on":["[[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.1 and §3.2.3; print210,272; PDF222,284","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-transfinite-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-transfinite-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transfinite-induction — Transfinite Induction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9cc4e14a96f221dc\" href=\"?note=9cc4e14a96f221dc\" title=\"72-df-recursive-order-presentation\">72-df-recursive-order-presentation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.1 and §3.2.3; print210,272; PDF222,284"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq D^2\">\\(R\\subseteq D^2\\)</span> 为关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq D\">\\(P\\subseteq D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 为序数。下式首先是 ZFC 元语言中的谓词，不能直接放进算术对象语言的可证性位置。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对象公式版本使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cc4e14a96f221dc\" href=\"?note=9cc4e14a96f221dc\" title=\"72-df-recursive-order-presentation\">72-df-recursive-order-presentation</a> 已定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x}(A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)\\)</span>，必须同时指定关系代码、归纳变量及公式或集合参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prog},\\mathrm{TI},\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prog},\\mathrm{TI},\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> 是下式的元谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prog}(D,R,P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x\\in D\\ ((\\forall y\\in D\\ (\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\to y\\in P))\\to x\\in P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Prog}(D,R,P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x\\in D\\ ((\\forall y\\in D\\ (\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\to y\\in P))\\to x\\in P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\mathrm{Prog}(D,R,P)\\to P=D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\mathrm{Prog}(D,R,P)\\to P=D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,\\{\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle:\\beta\\in\\gamma\\in\\alpha\\},P)\\qquad(P\\subseteq\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,\\{\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle:\\beta\\in\\gamma\\in\\alpha\\},P)\\qquad(P\\subseteq\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall X\\subseteq D\\ (X\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\exists x\\in X\\ \\forall y\\in X\\ (\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin R)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall X\\subseteq D\\ (X\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\exists x\\in X\\ \\forall y\\in X\\ (\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin R)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall P\\subseteq D\\ \\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall P\\subseteq D\\ \\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第 IV 章 §1.1、§3.2.3，印刷 pp.210、272 / PDF pp.222、284。等价性的局部证明：若一个 progressive 集合 P≠D，补集的 R 极小元反驳progressiveness；反之若非空 X 没有极小元，D\\X 是 progressive 且不等于 D。没有在对象算术内量化元理论真类。旧式“沿序数α的缩写”等自然语言移至本节。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-recursive-order-presentation","status":"resolved","id":"9cc4e14a96f221dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-recursive-order-presentation","status":"resolved","id":"9cc4e14a96f221dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对象公式版本使用 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]] 已定义的 $\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x}(A)$ 与 $\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)$，必须同时指定关系代码、归纳变量及公式或集合参数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq D^2","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq D","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prog},\\mathrm{TI},\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prog}(D,R,P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x\\in D\\ ((\\forall y\\in D\\ (\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\to y\\in P))\\to x\\in P).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\mathrm{Prog}(D,R,P)\\to P=D).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,\\{\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle:\\beta\\in\\gamma\\in\\alpha\\},P)\\qquad(P\\subseteq\\alpha).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall X\\subseteq D\\ (X\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\exists x\\in X\\ \\forall y\\in X\\ (\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin R)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall P\\subseteq D\\ \\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P).","display":true}],"bytes":2072,"backlinks":[{"id":"9cb1e684c866136a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"元理论为ZFC；$\\mathrm{WF}$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]] 的前驱方向定义，$R^{-1}:=\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}$。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-306","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-transfinite-induction|df-transfinite-induction — Transfinite Induction]]"},{"id":"d7c1a223707e577d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]] 的元 $\\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P)$（P⊆D）；树上的Bar与BarInduction见 [[72-df-bar-induction]]。"},{"id":"ce118b25d2b12cdc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(O,\\prec)$ 与 $\\Phi_\\prec,\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec$ 取 [[72-df-accessible-ordinal]]；$\\mathrm{WF}$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]]；$\\operatorname{Down}$ 在下式局部定义。"},{"id":"6b40e3ecfaa895b6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]] 的元理论前驱良基性；[[72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence]] 给出同一关系与最小可及闭包的等价。这里的WF不是二阶算术中的对象公式WO。"}],"outgoing":["9cc4e14a96f221dc"]}